#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:51 5858d4b3c4424048a6bd8ea1be00d7fc
msgid "Example: Dobot to ARX"
msgstr "示例：从 Dobot 切换到 ARX"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:53 613493e5782d481a9bbbdc933a923443
msgid ""
"# Current: Dobot CR5\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=dobot_cr5 "
"hardware:=mock\n"
"\n"
"# Initialize ARX descriptions\n"
"cd src/robot_descriptions\n"
"git submodule update --init robot-descriptions-arx\n"
"\n"
"# Rebuild\n"
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"colcon build --packages-up-to robot-descriptions-arx\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with Acone (arm only, not Lift 2S)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone "
"hardware:=mock\n"
msgstr ""
"# Current: Dobot CR5\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=dobot_cr5 "
"hardware:=mock\n"
"\n"
"# Initialize ARX descriptions\n"
"cd src/robot_descriptions\n"
"git submodule update --init robot-descriptions-arx\n"
"\n"
"# Rebuild\n"
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"colcon build --packages-up-to robot-descriptions-arx\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with Acone (arm only, not Lift 2S)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone "
"hardware:=mock\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:70 c1b9ee2cb26e4fdea546815f52a1e359
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`arx_acone` is the manipulator. Full-body **ARX Lift 2S** (`arx_lift2s`) "
"uses `split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py` on the `arx-lift2s` "
"branch — see [ARX Lift 2S](9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md). "
"HighTorque Panthera HT launch name is `panthera_ht` — see [HighTorque "
"Panthera HT](9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)."
msgstr ""
"`arx_acone` 是操作臂。全身 **方舟无限 Lift 2S**（`arx_lift2s`）在 `arx-lift2s` 分支上使用 "
"`split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py` — 见 [方舟无限 Lift "
"2S](11-arx_lift2s.md)。高擎 Panthera HT 的 launch 名是 `panthera_ht` — 见 [高擎 "
"Panthera HT](12-panthera_ht.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:72 e1d6302c4e5544e491296ba797c90167
msgid "End-effectors (`type` / `left_type` / `right_type`)"
msgstr "末端执行器（`type` / `left_type` / `right_type`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:74 0d631882b36c4a6ba9176d0f4256ada9
msgid ""
"There is **no** `gripper:=` argument. End-effectors are selected by "
"**`robot_common_launch`**:"
msgstr "没有 **`gripper:=`** 参数。末端由 **`robot_common_launch`** 选择："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:76 c35d1d5b36b6478aaf69dfca933c4876
msgid "Symmetric EEF: `type:=<eef_key>`"
msgstr "对称末端：`type:=<eef_key>`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:77 7d06341cdd214128bf9575d89029b1c6
msgid "Different left / right: `left_type:=` and `right_type:=`"
msgstr "左右不同：`left_type:=` 与 `right_type:=`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:78 ee19ea0f06164d96b58e252736476e14
msgid ""
"`type` may also be arm topology `left` / `right` / `dual` (that does "
"**not** become `left_type` / `right_type`)"
msgstr "`type` 也可以是臂拓扑 `left` / `right` / `dual`（**不会**展开成 `left_type` / `right_type`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:80 ba80ac2e62c94efbb0931e06917d2e0a
msgid ""
"Profile YAML `defaults.end_effectors` is applied when "
"`use_profile_eef:=true` (default). Set `use_profile_eef:=false` to force "
"the CLI keys. Merge order: **CLI > profile > xacro defaults**. FT (`ft` /"
" `left_ft` / `right_ft`) and TCP offsets are separate and always take the"
" profile unless CLI overrides them."
msgstr ""
"`use_profile_eef:=true`（默认）时应用 profile YAML 的 `defaults.end_effectors`。设 `use_profile_eef:=false` 以强制使用命令行键。合并顺序：**CLI > profile > xacro 默认值**。力传感器（`ft` / `left_ft` / `right_ft`）和 TCP 偏移是独立项，除非 CLI 覆盖，否则始终使用 profile。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:82 d06c64094f6f4809bbdd46d70f8d258a
msgid ""
"# README: ignore profile EEF, set L/R from CLI\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py \\\n"
"  robot:=<robot_name> \\\n"
"  robot_profile:=/path/to/machine_profile.yaml \\\n"
"  use_profile_eef:=false \\\n"
"  left_type:=rg75 right_type:=linkerhand_o7"
msgstr ""
"# README: ignore profile EEF, set L/R from CLI\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py \\\n"
"  robot:=<robot_name> \\\n"
"  robot_profile:=/path/to/machine_profile.yaml \\\n"
"  use_profile_eef:=false \\\n"
"  left_type:=rg75 right_type:=linkerhand_o7"

